                        "entry_id": "6271b03c-83f4-344f-96df-8cf5b8832ac4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The structure at the front end of a tapeworm which, in the adult, has suckers and hooks by which it attaches itself to a host."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e89807ec-0de3-44f0-9d10-8b47e64e7561",
                                "sense_id": "5510c197-396a-3fed-a4fd-0b024b77e64e",
                                "text": "The head, with the circle of hooklets and the four suckers, is then formed at the anterior part of the embryo, constituting now the scolex of Van Beneden."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
